    4. Build output as 10 x (sum(max(h_i,w_i))+N-1) bg grid. Paint upper band (short x long, top-aligned) and lower band (long x short, bottom-aligned) with independent column cursors and 1-col gaps. Reject any dimension set where the resulting output footprints overlap.
